Date: Sun, 23 Jun 2024 10:41:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] color-selection: Fall back to X11

This restores native X11 color picking as a fallback when portal-based
color picking fails.

Partially reverts commit f68055ce3f91001503a31753b03836b6cf86b3dd.
---
